  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fX8X71FI3YO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img height=\"36\" style=\"border:0px\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/SQ5ZLKg5/support-me-on-kofi-beige.png\" alt=\"在 ko-fi.com 贊助我\"></a></p>\n<h2>簡介</h2>\n<p>此資源包將按鈕、圖形介面與選單介面替換為較暗的版本。所使用的按鈕來自基岩版。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b582283187ea9a908e68b7b5b5f0b52a7ff956ba.jpeg\" alt=\"預覽\"></p>\n<p>已替換：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>玩家物品欄</li>\n<li>成就介面</li>\n<li>選單介面</li>\n<li>以下模組的介面：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252freplaymod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ReplayMod</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris Shaders</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fscreenshot-viewer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Screenshot Viewer</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frecursiveresources\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Recursive Resources</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcamera-utils\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Camera Utils</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fowo-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">oωo (owo-lib)</a></li>\n<li>鐵砧介面</li>\n<li>信標介面</li>\n<li>高爐介面</li>\n<li>鍊金爐介面</li>\n<li>製圖台介面</li>\n<li>製造機介面</li>\n<li>工作台介面</li>\n<li>發射器與投擲器介面</li>\n<li>附魔台介面</li>\n<li>熔爐介面</li>\n<li>切換遊戲模式介面</li>\n<li>木桶介面</li>\n<li>磨石介面</li>\n<li>漏斗介面</li>\n<li>馬匹介面</li>\n<li>紡織台介面</li>\n<li>鍛造台介面</li>\n<li>煙燻爐介面</li>\n<li>切石機介面</li>\n<li>村民介面</li>\n<li>所有潛影盒介面</li>\n<li>箱子介面</li>\n<li>終界箱介面</li>\n<li>聖誕節箱子介面</li>\n</ul>\n<p>前四行所寫的內容僅在安裝 OptiFine 時才會生效。此資源包支援兩種語言：英文、俄文。</p>",
